# Ensure launcher scripts always check out with the right line endings,
# regardless of the contributor's OS. Wrong endings break these scripts:
#   - Windows .bat files need CRLF (labels/goto misbehave with LF).
#   - Unix shell scripts need LF.
*.bat   text eol=crlf
*.cmd   text eol=crlf
*.command text eol=lf
*.sh    text eol=lf
